{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38617","headline":"荅门生王涣李德邻赵光胤王拯长句 · 孙偓","name":"荅门生王涣李德邻赵光胤王拯长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谬持文柄得时贤，粉署清华次第迁。\n昔岁策名皆健笔，今朝称职并同年。\n各怀器业宁推让，俱上青霄肯後先。\n何事老夫犹赋咏，欲将酬和永留传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}